WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:10.600
Kestrel — automated investing on Solana, powered by tokenized U.S. equities.

00:11.800 --> 00:17.400
Connect your wallet. No forms, no paperwork.

00:17.400 --> 00:22.600
Choose the portfolio that fits your risk.

00:22.600 --> 00:28.600
Kestrel monitors your allocation 24/7.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
Roost — capital preservation. Perch — a balanced core.

00:36.000 --> 00:42.500
Soar — built for growth. Apex — our most aggressive strategy.

00:42.500 --> 00:52.400
Every portfolio holds real tokenized equities, gold, and cash reserves.

00:54.000 --> 01:01.000
Markets drift — and drift pulls your portfolio off target.

01:01.000 --> 01:09.500
When drift crosses a defined band, Kestrel rebalances — trimming winners, adding to laggards.

01:09.500 --> 01:19.400
Buying low, selling high — systematically, without emotion.

01:20.600 --> 01:25.400
Non-custodial. Your assets stay in your wallet — always.

01:25.400 --> 01:31.400
Kestrel — the future of Solana investing. Illustrative simulation, not a projection of returns.
